{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive, Kill and Share It!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Single player and co-op!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/0558bb2e032501c1658056c82eb80003.poster.avif?t=1763838806\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/0558bb2e032501c1658056c82eb80003.webm?t=1763838806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/0558bb2e032501c1658056c82eb80003.mp4?t=1763838806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or team up with your friend in local or online co-op! Work together to cause chaos and stream your wild adventures while traveling New York! It\u2019s more fun when you\u2019re surviving\u00a0<i>together</i>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your team, your base</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather survivors, build your own base and fight!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conquer New-York</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The whole map of New York is available for you. Each faction fights for every territory of New York: different groups of survivors, the army and zombies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Create your own unique character!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/8e6bb537f1d92d4a68f490d897b3add0.poster.avif?t=1763838806\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/8e6bb537f1d92d4a68f490d897b3add0.webm?t=1763838806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/8e6bb537f1d92d4a68f490d897b3add0.mp4?t=1763838806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character in the game is unique and you will create your own! Customise your character however you like. There are hundreds of cosmetic items available that you either get for free or from achievements.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play Minigames!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/55c4604a1e7b96b4be6f013f5fdfdf89.poster.avif?t=1763838806\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/55c4604a1e7b96b4be6f013f5fdfdf89.webm?t=1763838806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/55c4604a1e7b96b4be6f013f5fdfdf89.mp4?t=1763838806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll visit dozens of location and each one of them has its own mini-game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Advanced AI.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/95e408e6633dc39e587eff62c01726c9.poster.avif?t=1763838806\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/95e408e6633dc39e587eff62c01726c9.webm?t=1763838806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/extras/95e408e6633dc39e587eff62c01726c9.mp4?t=1763838806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every character has a unique life. They have:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Their own personality (affects behavior and dialogues with them)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Style;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Job;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RPG skills and attributes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347830?t=1763838806","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3347830?t=1763838806","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/2652b7e2e81765907df90d5786eb33cb74a97e1b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763838806","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3347830/2652b7e2e81765907df90d5786eb33cb74a97e1b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763838806","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Steam Turn Notifications","id":32},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><stro